<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><title>KAOPU Fish R13 · 中心脊椎与鱼鳍权重</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;font-family:Inter,"Noto Sans SC","Microsoft YaHei",system-ui,sans-serif;--bg:#06101a;--panel:#0c1724;--line:#20364b;--cyan:#5edcff;--text:#edf5ff;--muted:#8da5bd;--orange:#ff9a54;--green:#71f2c1}*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);overflow:hidden}button,select,input{font:inherit}button,select{color:var(--text);background:#101f30;border:1px solid #2b425a;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 10px}button{cursor:pointer}button:hover,button.active{border-color:var(--cyan);background:#15344a}.app{height:100%;display:grid;grid-template-rows:64px minmax(0,1fr) 38px}.topbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:0 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#08111d}.mark{width:36px;height:36px;border:1px solid #31516d;border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:800}.title{min-width:0}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#78c9e5;font-weight:700}.title h1{font-size:16px;margin:4px 0 0;font-weight:650;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}.status{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.main{min-height:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 380px}.stage{position:relative;min-width:0;min-height:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 60% 25%,#142b40 0,#08111d 45%,#050a11 100%)}#gl{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none}.panel-label{position:absolute;top:14px;left:14px;padding:8px 11px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(5,12,21,.76);border:1px solid rgba(83,143,184,.35);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);pointer-events:none;font-size:12px}.panel-label strong{display:block;font-size:13px}.panel-label span{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}.label-left{left:14px}.label-right{left:14px}.controls{overflow:auto;border-left:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0d1927,#09131e)}.section{padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.section h2{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#9db2c7;margin:0 0 11px}.button-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px}.button-grid button{font-size:11px;min-height:35px}.views{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.mini-actions{display:flex;gap:7px;margin-top:9px}.mini-actions button{flex:1}.row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin:9px 0}.row label{font-size:12px;color:#b8c9d8}.row input[type=range]{width:160px}.checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:#bdccda}.checks label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.metric{padding:10px;border:1px solid #263b50;border-radius:9px;background:#0a1521;font-size:12px;color:#b8c9d8;margin-top:8px;line-height:1.6}.metric strong{color:#e9f7ff}.compact{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)}.warn{color:#ffb98e;font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;margin-top:8px}.footer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;padding:0 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:#070e17;color:#8098ae;font:11px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace}.footer span:first-child{color:#b8d7e9}.loader{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:20;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#050a11;transition:opacity .35s}.loader.done{opacity:0;pointer-events:none}.loader.failed{background:#17090b}.load-card{width:min(500px,86vw);padding:24px;border:1px solid #29435b;border-radius:16px;background:#0a1522;box-shadow:0 24px 80px #0008}.load-title{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:7px}.load-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:18px}.load-track{height:7px;background:#172536;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}.load-fill{height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#45c7ff,#71f2c1);transition:width .18s}.load-text{font-size:12px;color:#b7d4e6;margin-top:11px}details{border:1px solid #20364b;border-radius:10px;background:#091522;margin-top:8px}summary{cursor:pointer;padding:10px 11px;font-size:12px;color:#d7e7f3;user-select:none}.weight-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px 9px;padding:0 10px 11px}.weight-row{min-width:0}.weight-row label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:5px;font-size:10px;color:#a9bdce}.weight-row b{font-weight:500;color:#dff7ff}.weight-row input{width:100%;height:16px}.bar{height:3px;background:#16283a;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}.bar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4ad0ff,#ffb45c);transition:width .12s}.eye-card{padding:10px;border:1px solid #3a4d30;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#111c1b,#16170c);margin-top:8px}.eye-card strong{color:#ffd77a}.player .composer-only{display:none}
@media(max-width:920px){.app{grid-template-rows:54px minmax(0,1fr) 34px}.topbar{padding:0 10px;gap:8px}.mark{width:30px;height:30px}.eyebrow{font-size:8px}.title h1{font-size:13px}.status{display:none}.main{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-rows:minmax(0,1fr) 330px}.controls{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.section{padding:10px}.button-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.views{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}button,select{padding:7px 6px;font-size:10px}.row{margin:6px 0}.row input[type=range]{width:125px}.footer{gap:10px;padding:0 9px;font-size:9px}.footer span:nth-child(n+3){display:none}.weight-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.panel-label{top:9px;left:9px}}
</style></head><body><div class="app"><header class="topbar"><div class="mark">K13</div><div class="title"><div class="eyebrow">KAOPU · SAMPLED PARAMETRIC SURFACE / INTERACTIVE SCHOOL</div><h1>鱼群 R13 · 30 条 · 鼠标互动群游</h1></div><div class="status"><span id="fps">— FPS</span><span id="clock">0.00 s</span></div></header>
<main class="main"><section class="stage"><canvas id="gl"></canvas><div id="teacherLabel" class="panel-label label-left"><strong>同谱静止基准</strong><span>静态眼窝与独立眼球，同一正式乐器</span></div><div class="panel-label label-right" id="activeLabel"><strong id="modeNow">连续巡游</strong><span>完整脊椎传导 · 7 组鱼鳍权重 · KFE1 独立眼球</span></div></section>
<aside class="controls"><div class="section"><h2>鱼群 / 个体检查</h2><label class="compact"><input id="schoolToggle" type="checkbox" checked> 显示 30 条鱼群</label><div class="mini-actions"><button id="wholeSchool">整个鱼群</button><button id="singleFish">选中单鱼</button></div><div class="checks" style="margin-top:10px"><label><input id="pointerToggle" type="checkbox" checked>鼠标／触摸互动</label></div><div class="mini-actions"><button id="disturb">中央扰动</button></div><div class="compact">移入鱼群，附近的鱼逐渐避让；点击或轻触产生扰动，随后恢复巡游。Alt＋拖动旋转，右键／Shift＋拖动平移，滚轮缩放。</div><select id="fishSelect" style="width:100%;margin-top:9px"></select><div class="compact" id="groupNow"></div><div class="metric" id="variantNow"></div><div class="row"><label>摆动幅度 <span id="swingValue">1.00×</span></label><input id="swing" type="range" min=".5" max="1.35" value="1" step=".05"></div><div class="compact">以原模型逐点采样的参数曲面与残差复刻身体；30 条共享完整表面，前后、上下错位地游动，按邻鱼保持间距和方向，转向与各自速度衔接。尺寸、体型和色调只有小幅差异。蓝灰色调只有细微明暗差别；眼睛会短暂轻扫、停留注视，个体节奏各不相同。保留当前 KFE1 眼睛。</div></div>
<div class="section"><h2>01 / 中心脊椎动作</h2><div class="button-grid" id="motions"></div><div class="mini-actions"><button id="play">暂停</button><button id="step">单步 1/30 秒</button><button id="resetTime">重新示范</button></div><div class="row"><label>播放倍率 <span id="speedValue">1.00</span>×</label><input id="speed" type="range" min=".1" max="2.5" step=".05" value="1"></div><div class="row"><label>推进强度 <span id="amplitudeValue">1.00</span>×</label><input id="amplitude" type="range" min="0" max="1.5" step=".05" value="1"></div><div class="compact">推进强度控制尾摆节律与幅度；弯曲波沿脊椎向后传递，尾鳍跟随尾柄运动。播放倍率只用于观察快慢。身体截面完整跟随脊椎，七组鱼鳍保持独立权重。</div></div>
<div class="section composer-only"><h2>02 / 鱼鳍权重与当前响应</h2><details open><summary>展开 7 组鱼鳍权重</summary><div class="weight-grid" id="weightSliders"></div></details><div class="mini-actions"><button id="resetWeights">全部鱼鳍恢复 1.00×</button></div><div class="compact">彩条显示当前动作经过缓入后的实际响应；滑块是验收倍率，不会改变原始表面连接。</div></div>
<div class="section"><h2>03 / 眼睛单独处理</h2><div class="button-grid views"><button data-view="eyePos">+Z 眼特写</button><button data-view="eyeNeg">−Z 眼特写</button><button data-view="eyes">双眼正视</button><button id="eyeIsolate">隔离眼窝</button></div><div class="mini-actions"><button id="eyeTrack">自动追踪示范</button></div><div class="row"><label>手动左右 <span id="eyeYawValue">0.00</span></label><input id="eyeYaw" type="range" min="-.26" max=".26" step=".01" value="0"></div><div class="row"><label>手动上下 <span id="eyePitchValue">0.00</span></label><input id="eyePitch" type="range" min="-.15" max=".15" step=".01" value="0"></div><div class="row"><label>瞳孔偏置 <span id="pupilValue">0.00</span></label><input id="pupil" type="range" min="-.45" max=".45" step=".01" value="0"></div><div class="checks"><label><input id="eyes" type="checkbox" checked>显示替换眼球</label></div><div class="eye-card"><strong>KFE1 分层眼球</strong><div id="eyeEvidence" class="compact">载入中</div><div id="eyeNow" class="compact">眼球状态</div></div><div class="warn">眼位、朝向与直径从原模型完整表面测得；眼球、虹膜、瞳孔、角膜改为独立参数层。没有资料支持的眼睑或眨眼结构，本轮不自行添加。</div></div>
<div class="section"><h2>04 / 表面与权重检查</h2><select id="renderMode" style="width:100%"><option value="0">蓝灰 4K 表面光照</option><option value="4">蓝灰表面（无灯光）</option><option value="1">白模形体</option><option value="2">表面法线</option><option value="3">UV 地址</option><option value="5">7 组鱼鳍权重综合色</option><option value="6">单鳍权重热图</option><option value="7">眼窝隔离</option><option value="8">当前鱼鳍有效响应</option></select><select id="weightChannel" style="width:100%;margin-top:7px"></select><div class="checks" style="margin-top:9px"><label><input id="wire" type="checkbox">抽样线框</label><label><input id="normalMap" type="checkbox" checked>法线图</label><label><input id="compare" type="checkbox">静止／动态对照</label></div><div class="metric"><strong id="stats">载入中</strong><br>当前推进输入：<span id="drive">0.000</span><br><span id="gaitNow">尾摆 — Hz · 推进估计 — 体长／秒</span><br>497,701 点全部有结构地址；前段较稳，弯曲波向尾部传播；所有鳍保留源拓扑。</div></div>
<div class="section"><h2>05 / 局部和固定视角</h2><div class="button-grid views"><button data-view="jaw">完整下颌</button><button data-view="finPos">胸鳍 +Z</button><button data-view="finNeg">胸鳍 −Z</button><button data-view="left">左侧</button><button data-view="right">右侧</button><button data-view="perspective">斜侧</button><button data-view="top">俯视</button><button data-view="bottom">仰视</button><button data-view="head">头向</button><button data-view="tail">尾向</button><button id="export">导出设置</button></div><div class="compact">鱼群互动时 Alt＋拖动旋转；单鱼直接拖动旋转。滚轮缩放；Shift／右键拖动平移。</div></div>
<div class="section"><h2>范围与风险</h2><div class="warn">推进估计用于观察强弱，不代表实测游速；鱼群以邻近分离／对齐／聚合跟随路线，距离约束使用保守包围球，尚非实测生态行为。鱼鳍作用范围由原表面及鳍根向外距离重新约束；同源接缝共用运动绑定；动作响应比是技术演示参数，不是已测量的组织刚度、肌肉力或 CFD。独立眼球改善可控性，但仍需你检查眼窝贴合、大小、虹膜颜色和视线幅度。</div><div class="compact">visualAcceptance = false<br>motionAcceptance = false<br>productionReady = false</div></div>
</aside></main><footer class="footer"><span id="version">R13 · KFC13</span><span>m · Y↑</span><span>30 independent fish / 7 fin channels</span><span>Space 播放／暂停</span></footer></div>
